# Market Gnome's second ability triggers on being exiled "from the battlefield" (CR 603.2, 603.6c): a Gnome card that is
# exiled from the graveyard as craft material (CR 702.167a, an artifact card from your graveyard) has already left the
# battlefield, so nothing triggers. On turn three Bot1 Lightning Bolts its own Gnome (it dies: one life, one card from its first
# ability) and then crafts Dire Flail, choosing the Gnome card in the graveyard as the material. Bot1 ends at 21 life with
# the two cards, not 22 with three: the exile from the graveyard changes nothing.

